  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_39649242441846f3a603a9eeadb46af9",
      "statement": "FlexAnnotate's Citavi import exists because Zotero's Citavi XML translator only imports //Annotations/Annotation nodes carrying PDF Quads and skips sources without an attachment, so quotes on print sources — which exist only as <KnowledgeItem> — are dropped and must be converted into print annotations by a second import pass.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L1-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a8e5abd50fc23708b4bf1a1443a31b3fbc5e1749260f62a7164eb7ed0b3256f6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviPrintQuotes.ts#L105-L113",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8618e8e79d5712e3c07ae18ef3a33682aeadbd5a05b523dd21ff9dd349131767:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_60d8cd9d7f15440ca75a06d2c6b070c4",
      "statement": "The Citavi pass uses a dual patch design: CitaviImport.patch() wraps Zotero.Translate.Import.prototype.translate to detect a Citavi export (translator label matching /^Citavi (?:[56]) XML/i) and park the finished translation object (_itemSaver._IDMap, _io, _sandboxZotero) in module state as `pending`, while per-window wrappers of Zotero_File_Interface.importFile/importFromClipboard decide when the pass runs by triggering _runPending() in their finally block.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L124-L159",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5098d9ea4a2508982f64b1755ef85d21c796a426ec240acb9ff22bef703d7896:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L31-L105",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6be599c482e048317c090fe3035651a4cac0fb973f4a6943553b0a40af023eab:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviLinks.ts#L10-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f25ad54722802c22ecefbc0f618c9103237aa459a403297e5c78be4dbac08db3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6ac062a8bd9b4f19ae1664f43ead5129",
      "statement": "The ordering of the Citavi passes is load-bearing: Zotero's own pass attaches PDF-anchored quotes to getAttachments()[0] of the source, so if FlexAnnotate's placeholder PDF were created (or sorted) before Zotero's pass, PDF annotations would land on the placeholder — which is why the pass runs after Zotero's annotation pass and the unsequenced fallback path logs an explicit warning.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L147-L155",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0c1cca7d7cefc7c73289842fb53b3925da6e6be9ca450e72cc17bcfebc51ddd8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L20-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:08de10415ff86b676a5f276a693661dc94ce3d845a334a8b6728a31548e51b5a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_de9e7f0da071459f8a7243ad98e80108",
      "statement": "Because Zotero_File_Interface is not a singleton — every window loading fileInterface.js has its own object, including the import wizard — CitaviImport patches importFile and importFromClipboard per window, registers a Services.ww observer on domwindowopened to patch newly opened windows on load, and tracks sequenced windows in a Set<Window> (not a boolean flag) so the sequenced state returns to empty when the last such window closes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L182-L222",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ed93fa0a5029e1962aea8ac06b2ccede91acdbe5a06a6d57d6e311dda71ed3ed:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L228-L283",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:73667225b08632dc48de5f121f3962f2e9c0088ecff415bd8bc8da09785ea2d2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L42-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1383f9d5d7757385b6d090750073e6a425f0b631ecc0671344844ba84c451d8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_98292ee4d00f48a883823767b55e638f",
      "statement": "The parked translation is redeemed exactly once: window import wrappers null any stale `pending` before the native import, _runPending() consumes it (setting it to null first), and gates the two sub-passes independently — importPrintQuotes under the citaviImport pref and linkContributions under citaviLinkContributions — each in its own try/catch so a failure in one cannot abort the other or the already-imported items.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviImport.ts#L248-L255",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4cfec68a02e217f335939f00ab53e19fd35a904f95b1dc03031104db061f43de:"
        },
        {
