    {
      "id": "claim_5b34cb18182e42e5a7749399d0876048",
      "statement": "Keywords are resolved from //KnowledgeItemKeywords/OnetoN texts (`ID:…;KeywordID:…;…`) by comparing the first member's owner id for exact equality with the KnowledgeItem's id in JavaScript — fixing the earlier XPath starts-with prefix match that let owner id K1 hit the node of K10 — and keyword ids are interpolated into XPath only through xpathLiteral(), which switches quote style or builds concat() for values containing both quote characters.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/features/citavi/citaviPrintQuotes.ts#L56-L74",
