    {
      "id": "claim_134e56c757d242359ac9177f976dcc1d",
      "statement": "Pure parsing and text logic for the Citavi pass (QUOTATION_TYPES, locator prefs, normalizeText/stripMarkup, isPageTail, isQuoteNote, parsePageRange, splitOnetoN/resolveKeywords, xpathLiteral, isDuplicateAnnotation, buildAnnotationData) lives in src/features/citavi/logic/citavi.ts with dependencies injected (PrefGetter, keyword nameOf) so it runs under Node and is covered by test-unit/citavi.test.ts, while all Zotero-dependent parts (patches, window hooks, XML reading, note erasure) stay in the feature files.",
