    {
      "id": "claim_ae4dd5dbd71f4b2cbba54b04e1041142",
      "statement": "The Citavi import is registered as the `citaviImport` feature in src/hooks.ts (start → CitaviImport.patch, stop → unpatch, addToWindow/removeFromWindow for per-window sequencing) and exposed on addon.api.citavi together with importPrintQuotes and linkContributions, which is the surface the Zotero integration tests drive.",
