    {
      "id": "claim_cf75e029550342cea2802b238145399c",
      "statement": "The pass is configured by stable preferences under extensions.flexannotate.: citaviImport (default true) enables print-quote import, citaviLinkContributions (default true) enables relation linking, citaviKeepNotes (default false) keeps the translator's notes, and citaviLocatorPage/Column/Paragraph/Margin/Other set the CSL locator per Citavi numbering type; with both action prefs off, _afterTranslate returns before even checking the translator label.",
